ES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do 2\u00ba Trail Conv\u00edvio Mestre Alfaiate 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 29 de Agosto de 2026. A partida do Trail de 15 km ocorre \u00e0s 09:00 e as provas de Trail Kids t\u00eam in\u00edcio a partir das 10:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localiza o secretariado e a zona de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado e a zona de partida e chegada concentram-se no Campo de Futebol de Casais de Revelhos, em Abrantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Trail de 15 km (500m D+) e o Trail Kids dividido nos escal\u00f5es Sub-16 (3 km \/ 110m D+), Sub-14 (2 km \/ 75m D+) e Sub-12 (1 km \/ 60m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail de 15 km tem o custo de 10\u20ac (com almo\u00e7o opcional para acompanhantes a 5\u20ac) e a participa\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Kids \u00e9 gratuita.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e onde posso inscrever-me?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Casa do Benfica em Abrantes e as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no portal Trilho Perdido.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00ba Trail Conv\u00edvio Mestre Alfaiate 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-08-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Campo de Futebol de Casais de Revelhos\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Abrantes\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Casa do Benfica em Abrantes\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do 2\u00ba Trail Conv\u00edvio Mestre Alfaiate 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 29 de Agosto de 2026. A partida do Trail de 15 km ocorre \u00e0s 09:00 e as provas de Trail Kids t\u00eam in\u00edcio a partir das 10:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localiza o secretariado e a zona de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado e a zona de partida e chegada concentram-se no Campo de Futebol de Casais de Revelhos, em Abrantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra o Trail de 15 km (500m D+) e o Trail Kids dividido nos escal\u00f5es Sub-16 (3 km \/ 110m D+), Sub-14 (2 km \/ 75m D+) e Sub-12 (1 km \/ 60m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail de 15 km tem o custo de 10\u20ac (com almo\u00e7o opcional para acompanhantes a 5\u20ac) e a participa\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Kids \u00e9 gratuita.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\"